      "body": "This change seems not fix the issue.\r\n\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/Python/ceval.c b/Python/ceval.c\r\nindex 924afaa974..14c9ba9ad0 100644\r\n--- a/Python/ceval.c\r\n+++ b/Python/ceval.c\r\n@@ -4061,9 +4061,15 @@ _PyEval_LoadName(PyThreadState *tstate, _PyInterpreterFrame *frame, PyObject *na\r\n                             \"no locals found\");\r\n         return NULL;\r\n     }\r\n-    if (PyMapping_GetOptionalItem(frame->f_locals, name, &value) < 0) {\r\n+    PyObject *locals = frame->f_locals;\r\n+    Py_INCREF(locals);\r\n+\r\n+    if (PyMapping_GetOptionalItem(locals, name, &value) < 0) {\r\n+        Py_DECREF(locals);\r\n         return NULL;\r\n     }\r\n+\r\n+    Py_DECREF(locals);\r\n     if (value != NULL) {\r\n         return value;\r\n     }\r\n```\r\n\r\n```cli\r\n\r\n[hyi@rocky cpython]$ ./python ttt.py \r\n=================================================================\r\n==24620==ERROR: AddressSanitizer: heap-use-after-free on address 0xffffb3a0b4b0 at pc 0x0000005ec568 bp 0xffffc7bb72e0 sp 0xffffc7bb72d0\r\nREAD of size 8 at 0xffffb3a0b4b0 thread T0\r\n    #0 0x5ec564 in compare_generic Objects/dictobject.c:1114\r\n    #1 0x5ec564 in do_lookup Objects/dictobject.c:1009\r\n    #2 0x5ec564 in dictkeys_generic_lookup Objects/dictobject.c:1128\r\n    #3 0x5ec564 in _Py_dict_lookup Objects/dictobject.c:1294\r\n    #4 0x5f4500 in _PyDict_GetItemRef_KnownHash Objects/dictobject.c:2425\r\n    #5 0x5f4500 in PyDict_GetItemRef Objects/dictobject.c:2460\r\n    #6 0x59d0b4 in framelocalsproxy_getitem Objects/frameobject.c:207\r\n    #7 0x4fc67c in PyObject_GetItem Objects/abstract.c:163\r\n    #8 0x4fc67c in PyMapping_GetOptionalItem Objects/abstract.c:215\r\n    #9 0x81c358 in _PyEval_LoadName Python/ceval.c:4067\r\n    #10 0x432558 in _PyEval_EvalFrameDefault Python/generated_cases.c.h:8966\r\n    #11 0x81d354 in _PyEval_EvalFrame Include/internal/pycore_ceval.h:119\r\n    #12 0x81d354 in _PyEval_Vector Python/ceval.c:2542\r\n    #13 0x81d35